{
 "type": "doc",
 "content": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "A page is where people meet. The comments and the reaction on this page are examples: reply to them, resolve them, or delete them."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Mentions"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Type @ and a name to mention someone, like "
    },
    {
     "type": "mention",
     "attrs": {
      "id": "@person:owner",
      "kind": "user"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ". They hear about it once, and the name follows when it changes."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Tasks"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The first person and the first date in the line of a task count. The task then shows in Your tasks, in the account menu."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "taskList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "taskItem",
     "attrs": {
      "checked": false
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Try out this example "
        },
        {
         "type": "mention",
         "attrs": {
          "id": "@person:owner",
          "kind": "user"
         }
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " "
        },
        {
         "type": "date",
         "attrs": {
          "value": "2030-01-15"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Comments"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Select any words on a page and press Comment. The words you select stay marked while the page changes around them. Press m to go to the comment box, and n and p to move between comments."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Watching and sharing"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Press w to watch a page, and the bell tells you what changes. Share tells someone about a page, and says who can see it. It never gives anyone access."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
